<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Petroleum Securities a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Petroleum Securities a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it initiated coverage of Petroleum Securities Australia Ltd with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Despositary Receipts gained 1-1/2 to 27 in late morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
